      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report the case of a 41-year-old woman who presented with ipsilateral synchronous low-grade juxtacortical osteogenic sarcoma of the distal femur and low-grade intramedullary osteogenic sarcoma of the proximal tibia. The diagnosis and treatment and a review of the literature also are provided."},
